A73. Burns fat. ~ FRIES
A74. The chosen few. ~ ELITE
A75. Lonely achers, ~ OLDMAIDS
A76. Beer has filled this up again. ~ GLASS

D1. This breaks up the time in prison. ~ PAROLE
D2. Holey opportunity. ~ OPENING
D3. Vanishing American embalmed in puzzles. ~ UTE
D4. The devil you say. ~ NED
D5. Wet smacks. ~ DRYS
D6. Bursts upon, like the morning glory. ~ DAWNS
D7. Greek letter. ~ ETA
D8. A girl friend. ~ BOY
D9. This is not. (prefix.) ~ UN
D10. Somebody's baby doll. ~ KEWPIE
