D12. Brought the blind tiger his sight. ~ REPEALED
D14. Tells the world, under the sheepskin. ~ BAAS
D18. The kind of case that likes to tell his story. ~ SAD
D21. The day of days. ~ PAY
D24. This takes strength to do. ~ FEAT
D25. The strings attached to your radio. ~ TRIOS
D27. This kind of dropper drops bad medicine. ~ EAVES
D28. A word for those who sing without the words. ~ TRA
D31. Underworld characters. ~ GNOME
D33. Shut up. ~ CLOSE
D36. Collected, as shekels and dead leaves. ~ RAKED
D37. This makes a cold spell. ~ ICE
D38. Level header. ~ SANER
D40. Spain's "step"-daughters do this very well. ~ FANDANGO
D44. To talk your head off. ~ RAVE
